  "finalReply": "Installed `pyknotid 0.5.3` from source (`/app/pyknotid`) to global Python with NumPy `2.3.0`, with rebuilt Cython extensions.\n\n**Build:**\n- Installed `Cython` + `setuptools`, ran `python setup.py build_ext --inplace`, then `pip install --no-build-isolation --force-reinstall --no-deps .` (used `--no-deps` to keep NumPy at `2.3.0` instead of upgrading to `2.5.x`).\n- Compiled extensions present in source and site-packages: `chelpers`, `ccomplexity`, `cinvariants`, `coctree` (all import OK on NumPy 2.3.0).\n\n**NumPy 2 / Python 3 fixes (cause, not just instance):**\n- `pyknotid/make/torus.py`: `from fractions import gcd` → `from math import gcd` (removed in Py3.9+).\n- Removed aliases `np.int/n.int`, `np.float/n.float`, `np.bool/n.bool`, `n.long`, `n.complex` → builtins `int/float/bool/complex` in: `invariants.py` (`dtype` + `isinstance` checks), `representations/{representation,dtnotation,gausscode}.py`, `simplify/octree.py`, `make/periodic_knot.py`, `spacecurves/{spacecurve,knot,openknot,periodiccell}.py`.\n- `spacecurves/ccomplexity.pyx` (3×): `dtype=np.int` → `dtype=np.int_` then rebuilt (runtime `AttributeError` on NumPy≥1.24 otherwise).\n- `representations/representation.py:_construct_planar_graph`: added compat shim mapping `planarity>=1.0` keys `vertex_position/vertex_start/vertex_end`, `edge_position/edge_start/edge_end` → `pos/start/end` (fixes `test_reconstructed_space_curve` `KeyError: 'pos'`).\n\n**Verification (global env, NumPy 2.3.0):**\n- README snippet in `/tmp` (no `PYTHONPATH`): `Knot(three_twist(100)).alexander_polynomial(-1)` → `6.999...` OK.\n- `pytest /app/pyknotid/tests/test_knot.py /app/pyknotid/tests/test_spacecurve.py`: `18 passed`.\n- Extension context checks: `vassiliev_degree_3()` via `cinvariants` → `-1`; `second_order_writhes(try_cython=True/False)` via `ccomplexity` match; `chelpers.find_crossings` importable and `test_compiled_vs_python_find_crossings` passes.",
